State machine
=============

      entry:
        transport telnet -> state_login_telnet
    
      state_login_telnet
          login              -> send user              -> pw
          password           -> send password          -> op
      pw
          password           -> send password          -> op
      op
          /\S+>\s$/          -> send set cli screen-length 0 -> op_ready
      op_ready
          /\S+>\s$/          -> send configure         -> conf
      conf
          /\S+#\s$/          -> send show command      -> capture
      capture
          /\S+#\s$/          -> capture_stop           -> logout
          (capture_start on entry)
      logout
          (send)             -> send exit              -> done

